@startuml sensor_ingest_trust_boundaries
!include ../style.puml
!pragma layout smetana

title Bridge sensor ingest trust boundaries\nJWT mint/revoke vs vbt_ live write vs service_role

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

package "Browser / grower session" as Browser {
  [Dashboard / settings UI] as UI
  component "User JWT\n(session Bearer)" as JWT
}

package "Headless bridge" as Headless {
  [Device / vendor bridge] as Device
  component "Bridge secret\nvbt_… (plaintext offline)" as Secret
}

package "Supabase Edge gateway" as Gateway {
  component "mint-bridge-token\nverify_jwt = true" as Mint
  component "revoke-bridge-token\nverify_jwt = true" as Revoke
  component "sensor-ingest-webhook\nverify_jwt = false" as Webhook
}

package "Handler-owned authZ" as Handler {
  component "authenticateBearer\nallowJwt: false\nSHA-256 hash lookup" as Auth
  component "requireLiveSensorEntitlement\nbilling (not the token)" as Ent
  component "tentScopeMatches +\nnormalize +\n30m freshness" as Gates
}

package "Data plane" as Data {
  database "bridge_tokens\nRLS metadata\nhash + prefix only" as BT
  database "sensor_readings\nservice_role upsert" as SR
  component "bump_bridge_token_usage\n(service RPC)" as Usage
  database "sensor_ingest_audit_log\nbest-effort" as Audit
}

UI --> JWT
JWT --> Mint : mint / list UX
JWT --> Revoke : revoke
Mint --> Ent
Mint --> BT : insert hash (caller JWT + RLS)
Revoke --> BT : one-way revoked_at

Device --> Secret
Secret --> Webhook : Bearer vbt_…
Webhook --> Auth
Auth --> BT : hash lookup (service_role)
Webhook --> Ent
Webhook --> Gates : checks only\n(no writes from Gates)
Webhook --> SR : 1. service_role upsert\nowner from token row\nbody user_id ignored
Webhook --> Usage : 2. after upsert,\nonly if insertedCount > 0
Webhook --> Audit : 3. best-effort append\n(never fails the ingest)

note right of Webhook
  **verify_jwt = false**
  paired with
  **handler-owned bridge authentication**
  — not public live-write permission.
end note

note bottom of SR
  Telemetry storage only.
  No AI Doctor invocation.
  No alert creation.
  No Action Queue write.
  No automation.
  No device control.
end note

note bottom of BT
  Client roles cannot clear revoked_at
  or forge usage counters (migrations
  20260804213000 / 20260804220000).
  Strict zero-skip DB harness may still
  be **BLOCKED** for runtime proof.
end note

@enduml
